benchmark_results/

# SCR-28 spike: the Tier-2 testbed is extracted from real recordings and contains
# genuine PII — never commit the raw extracts or PII-derived results. These guards
# ignore *every* real-PII extract regardless of filename (inputs.jsonl, gold.jsonl,
# inputs-v2.jsonl, per-recording subdirs, etc.), while keeping the committable
# synthetic *.example.jsonl exemplars and the results/.gitkeep placeholder.
# (.venv-pf is already covered by .venv-*/ above.) See benchmarks/scr28/README.md.
benchmarks/scr28/tier2_testbed/**/*.jsonl
!benchmarks/scr28/tier2_testbed/**/*.example.jsonl
benchmarks/scr28/results/*
!benchmarks/scr28/results/.gitkeep

